# Homepage — observability overlay

Platform pattern: `app-observability`. Dashboard layout: [`docs/grafana-dashboard-template.md`](../../docs/grafana-dashboard-template.md).

- Project label: `project=homepage`.
- Critical API synthetic: `/api/health` (stg + prod).
- Scrape: `AWS/Lambda`, `AWS/CloudFront` (incl. OriginLatency).
- Dashboards: `Homepage — Production` / `Homepage — Staging` — JSON at `infra/terraform/grafana/dashboards/homepage-prod.json` and `homepage-stg.json` (regenerate with `python3 infra/terraform/grafana/scripts/generate-env-dashboards.py`).
- Stack service account name used for publish: `homepage-terraform`.
- Probe script: `infra/terraform/grafana/scripts/probe-cloudflare-graphql.sh`.
